Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone of my dear friend, the great Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this? The bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you where his bone\Nwent, you best answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the bone's presence at the\Nmaximum security disciplinary wing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,right as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jolene make it so she\Ncan go to the discipline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,cell just to find that\Nsame bone belonging to Dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's way too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get my hands on it first, that\Ncreepy palesnake will soon follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,there's my father's stolen memory disk\Nthat the bastard is still holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who's got the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where would he be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Before someone beats me there and knocks\Nhim off, and I lose the bone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to get it at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the no? Please\Ntell me this shit didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,already happen please the\Nbattle is already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all disfigured and bloated. Every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,last body in this\Ndiscipline cell is fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a stand power. Holy shit! How\Nmany stand users are in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they the ones who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And what exactly did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But one user can have only one Stan power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The person that defeated all the prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,here can only be one of\Nthese two punks I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, they sent a shit ton more Stan\Nusers to this ward than I assumed before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there's still a Stan user\Nthat stimulates the human
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,conscience and makes them\Nwant to fight in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you stand with that gaping wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand is intriguing, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A stand of string, who'd have thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I also find it interesting that your\Ncombat moves are completely unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Most interesting of all, however,\Nis your dogged determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you've been gravely wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can tell you've already grown\Nmuch from that brutal fight just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When Pale Snake told me that he'd send\Nfour stand users here, including me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taken aback, as\NI'm sure you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of that many\Nnecessary to accomplish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But now the reason why is totally obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wants to eliminate you\Nfor good, which he clearly does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I am Kenzo,\Na sprightly 78 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to good health is\Neight hours of deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and of course urine therapy\Nevery day without fail
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's important to maintain good habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with it? Urine therapy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to play how gladly take\Nyou on I can do it American style?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how about French style?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese style work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, Italian Naples style.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All around the world, there's\Na finger that says fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get straight to the point, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All the dead you see didn't\Njust die, they were drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I drowned them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why their bodies are bloated and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,look like giant human\Nticks about to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And regrettably, it seems my\Nfirst opponent is not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,F .F., you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they caught me moving in\Nthe shadows of the bloated bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for my Grand Kudomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse somehow blocked my F .F.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was close indeed. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get here, F. F.?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But damn, I gotta say, it was\Na pretty close call, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And before you lose any more blood,\NI'm gonna fill those wounds. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw him with weather\Nforecast at Emporio's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have spun-finished business first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take this creepy old geezer out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Direction facing southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,127 degrees, 30 minutes, 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dripping down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to open your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to drown, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what stupid plan you've\Ngot, but actually, water is my jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For a trained person to drown\Nunder these circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it usually takes anywhere\Nbetween five to seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But only if they draw breath deep\Nenough to leave oxygen in the lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what binds them that precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If all the oxygen in\Nboth lungs were exhaled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have a far\Nless enjoyable outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,with only a few drops of water, a human\Nwould just drown and then die instantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,siphoned directly from your filthy mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I damaged your fourth\Ncervical spine vertebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a large nerve that\Nconnects right to your kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When one is under duress,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the adrenal glands secrete bodily fluid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,into the respiratory\Nmucosa like a lubricant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So From these few drops of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,she'd evoke a feeling of being\Nsuffocated by a giant wave. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm inside a normal human's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Petro, I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My body can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to drown too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,July, Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safer and wiser to\Nobserve them from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stand user\Nis that old geezer anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be evaluating his strengths\Nright now, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The main problem here, you see, is not the\Nold man's ability to drown other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fact that he dodged bullets...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's trite, but why aren't any\Nof the well-aimed shots hitting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a far more dangerous detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And what was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia or something prissy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I love you, and I've been\Ndying to see your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man's been\Nlocked up here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's served 40 years at this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a lunatic who enjoys\Ndrinking his own piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It had been ages since I'd\Nseen him in the men's ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned out he was here all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And now this decaying\Nfreak show is a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the fall of 1969, he\Nkilled 34 young men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was sentenced to 280 years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The equivalent of several lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That grinning gray carcass\Nwas only 37 back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He claimed to be the\Nguru of a secret cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was so successful that he even had
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,hollywood stars in this\Nbizarre little fringe group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But their activities led to issues between\Nhis rabid followers and outside society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So the police and fbi\Nstarted to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew he was fully cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So he and 34 of His\Nfollowers holed up in a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Florida villa and planned\Nout a mass suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't quite that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzo drugged his followers\Nso they would pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he set the building on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You see all the believers burned to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,except for one sole survivor who\Njust happened to be the cult leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just dumb luck, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strangely,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:10:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems the wall of the\Nbuilding nearest him collapsed in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,such a way that partly shielded\Nhim from the smoke and flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt though that he was\Nindeed willing to die since he was near
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,death when they found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's my point in telling you all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I've digressed a bit,\Nbut the fact is only he survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never get released from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,prison, but he wasn't\Nsentenced to death either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the reality behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you before\Nand I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can see your point of strength\Nas though you're made of glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the secret of the power\Nthat lies within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's patently clear that what\Nflows through every artery
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,in your body is very much\Nsomething other than blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing the source\Nof your stand in action,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,or is it a different organism entirely?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it will not affect\Nhow I'm going to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of vital points\Nand body composition,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you're essentially no different\Nthan a normal human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:12:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You will shed blood just\Nthe same. I assume by your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,stance you're ready to drown\Nonce again just be aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't survive this time West
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Southwest 225 degrees zero minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah there it is put\Nsomething on his hand again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what the hell is that what's\Nwith that weird slinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how utterly fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your dragon's direction is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF, he's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just wasting your time. Truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just wasting your time. Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, your real\Nenemy is that insane old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop shooting at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impervious, an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attacks will only pass through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward, danger approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming right at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no right to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only that old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason that old sack of shake\Nand dodge bullets is because of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is 78?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How does the Walking Dead\Nkick and punch so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To quote a phrase, I can now\Nenter the dragon. Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He tore his own arm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would he...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his arm is flying right\Nto the back of FF's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, FF blocked\Nit! That was so Bites!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed as soon as Kenzo\Ntouched that dragon stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,his arm disappeared in that same moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A smokescreen so he won't\Nsee his attack coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that dragon behind him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When you touch it, does\Nyour other arm tear off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But just like the user,\Nthe attack was weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle's result is already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.89,0:14:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not like anyone can actually\Npredict what happens, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, pipe down, you talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you give away everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be\Nneutral, remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're operating in bad faith, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must share your secret with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You opened your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no freaking way\Nthat was a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That inmate's glasses flew straight at\NFF and lodged themselves in their face?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm starting to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's feng shui in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's geomancy for the East Asians.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch Kenzo's movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if he's adjusting\Nto a certain direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:15:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacks coming from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One direction as if predetermined\Nand that stand on his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It just works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The only conclusion to be drawn is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With that dragon stand, Kenzo can perfectly\Ncontrol the direction of his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng shui?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you mean by direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as famous as astrology\Nand tarot card reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe more, but it's not fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,East Asian philosophy highlights the\Nidea that there are natural paths
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,of energy in the natural world\Nsuch as the flow of wind and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By knowing the direction\Nin which nature is flowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.15,0:16:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it helps people choose\Nsimilar paths for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng Shui is used to determine the good\Nand bad areas of the land, house, and room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If the direction of the\Nland or house is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it will affect the\Nresident's health, fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and even the whole family's\Nwell-being negatively.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In times of war, it is said that they\Nchecked the Feng Shui of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and thus could determine the\Nmost advantageous area of the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,fortress they could attack\Nfrom to bring down the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, if you build a\Nshrine in the weak zone of the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and can calm the evil energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the castle will gain a further\Nmore solidified defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, this same theory of feng\Nshui can also be applied to human bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even an attack called\Nfeng shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can control the direction\Nfrom which to attack your enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you're almost guaranteed\Na victory over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how alert and\Nprepared the target is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to approach\Nthem without being noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving them completely vulnerable,\Nand you can easily assassinate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.63,0:17:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlucky direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've now established\Nthe secret of Kenzo's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The unlucky course pointing\Nstraight toward FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon stand is\Npointing out the precise
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,direction for Kenzo to\Nkill them fast and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And at some point very soon, his attack\Nwill merge with that floating dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid FF's fate has\Nalready been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Kenzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent the last 40 years in prison\Nmastering the Feng Shui assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And that skill developed\Nas his stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Feng Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The direction to proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means, when he was on\Ndefense, that would explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why not one of the\Nbullets hit the old man either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying the feng\Nshui also protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,him as well as helped\Nhim try to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When he holds that dragon\Nstand in his hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,he reads which direction\Nis the best to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.45,0:18:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And while moving in that direction,\Nhe simultaneously launches his attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon is trying to show the\Ndirect line to kill again. FF, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those glasses were deliberately\Nmade to shoot right into your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the old man off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.95,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get too\Nclose to that dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no fucking sense to me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:19:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously, whatever you do, you\Ncan't allow him to touch it! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Drake's Dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They figured it out because you\Nhad to go and flap your scaly jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you rotting mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your henchman or your underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The art of feng shui belongs\Nto everyone, not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true that you can\Nutilize my power to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, next unlucky spot is here,\Nright above your left ear. Feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This direction has the utmost\Ncritical emergency alert ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lucky color is yellow, and your\Ncharm is a picture of a goldfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,if you have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, he's going\Naround behind you, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a knife hand strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even need to touch\Nthe dragon's direction for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The movement of his defending\Narm is also working as an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be Tai Chi training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.31,0:19:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:19:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.67,0:20:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If your defense works as an attack,\Nthen the reverse applies too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn about is fair play, old man. Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've grown tired of this, you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess now I need to utilize the dragon's\Ndirection to finish you off completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I forced your arm to\Nmerge with the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, that's the same\Nmove I employed in my attack before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get beaten\Nsense by your very own arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that did just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and my stand attack has merged\Nwith the course of your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my arm just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you responsible for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you there's an unlucky direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:20:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.27,0:21:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's caused by the\Ndirection's certain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no way of knowing\Nwhat's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next moments, but\Nif I were you, young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I would try my best to\Nprevent or minimize?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the inevitable damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Beth, hurry up and get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been destroyed by the meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The fan's gonna fall on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,what you have to worry\Nabout is not the fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the metal boomerang\Nheading I'm coming towards you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.23,0:22:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.61,0:22:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.05,0:23:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.99,0:23:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.69,0:23:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.55,0:23:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.49,0:23:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
